IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `jp-ai-domain`

-- Japan: Act No. 53 of 2025 (令和七年法律第五十三号) -- EVERY PROVISION, ONE ROW EACH.
-- A DRAFT. Not for use as advice. No domain expert and no lawyer qualified in
-- Japan has read this encoding against the source.
--
-- This module is the coverage table made executable. Each of Articles 1 to 28,
-- and each Supplementary Provision, is a row: whom it addresses, the Japanese
-- verb form it uses, what it means for a business operator (the seat), and which
-- of the searched-for mechanisms -- a duty to report, a penalty, publication of
-- a name, an investigation, inspection or order, a duty to comply with a request
-- -- it carries toward a private person. Articles 3, 4, 6 and 25 are split into
-- their paragraphs because their paragraphs differ in addressee or verb form.
--
-- Every row's mechanism list is EMPTY. That is the finding, written once per
-- provision, so that a reviewer holding the text can check it provision by
-- provision, and so that "no reporting duty", "no penalty" and "no naming" are
-- COMPUTED from the rows (jp-ai-operator.l4) rather than written as constants.
-- A reviewer who finds a mechanism adds it to a row, and the answers change.
--
-- Quotation. Each row quotes the English translation (an aid; raw file
-- ../../registers/source-bundle/ai-act-en.txt, cited src:N) and the Japanese
-- (authoritative; ai-act-ja.txt beside it, cited src:ai-act-ja:N). Quote lines
-- were generated with srcrefs.py, never retyped; the English PDF's page numbers
-- are left out of each run. Supplementary Provisions Articles 3 and 4 are quoted
-- in English only: the e-Gov Japanese text is an extract without them.


§ `Chapter I -- General Provisions (第一章　総則)`

-- src:17 | (Purpose)
-- src:18 | Article 1 The purpose of this Act is, in light of the fact that artificial
-- src:19 | intelligence-related technology constitutes a fundamental technology for the
-- src:20 | development of Japan's economy and society, with regard to measures for
-- src:21 | promotion of research and development, and utilization of artificial
-- src:22 | intelligence-related technology, to specify the basic principles, the basic plan
-- src:23 | for promoting research and development, and utilization of artificial
-- src:24 | intelligence-related technology and the basic matters that form the basis of
-- src:25 | other measures, as well as to achieve comprehensive and systematic promotion
-- src:26 | of measures for the promotion of research and development, and utilization of
-- src:27 | artificial intelligence-related technology by establishing an artificial
-- src:28 | intelligence strategic headquarters, in conjunction with measures under the
-- src:29 | Basic Act on Science, Technology and Innovation (Act No. 130, of 1995) , the
-- src:30 | Basic Act on the Formation of a Digital Society (Act No. 35, of 2021) and other
-- src:31 | related laws, and to contribute to the improvement the lives of the citizens and
-- src:32 | the sound development of the national economy.
-- 日本語 (authoritative):
-- src:ai-act-ja:10 | （目的）
-- src:ai-act-ja:11 | 第一条 この法律は、人工知能関連技術が我が国の経済社会の発展の基盤となる技術であることに鑑み、人工知能関連技術の研究開発及び活用の推進に関する施策について、基本理念並びに人工知能関連技術の研究開発及び活用の推進に関する基本的な計画の策定その他の施策の基本となる事項を定めるとともに、人工知能戦略本部を設置することにより、科学技術・イノベーション基本法（平成七年法律第百三十号）及びデジタル社会形成基本法（令和三年法律第三十五号）その他の関係法律による施策と相まって、人工知能関連技術の研究開発及び活用の推進に関する施策の総合的かつ計画的な推進を図り、もって国民生活の向上及び国民経済の健全な発展に寄与することを目的とする。
@ref Article 1 (src:17-32) (src:ai-act-ja:10-11)
GIVETH A `A provision`
`Article 1` MEANS
    `A provision` WITH
        `the provision`                         IS "Article 1"
        `in the main provisions`                IS TRUE
        `the article number`                    IS 1
        `part`                                  IS `Chapter I, General Provisions`
        `addressed to`                          IS `nobody: a purpose, a definition or a principle`
        `the verb form`                         IS `states the purpose (目的とする)`
        `what it means for a business operator` IS `none: not addressed to a business operator`
        `mechanisms affecting a private person` IS EMPTY

-- src:34 | (Definition)
-- src:35 | Article 2 The term "artificial intelligence-related technology" as used in this Act
-- src:36 | means technology necessary for realizing the function to substitute intellectual
-- src:37 | abilities for human cognition, inference and judgement by artificial means, and
-- src:38 | technology relating to information processing systems for realizing the function
-- src:39 | to process the input information and output that result by using the technology.
-- 日本語 (authoritative):
-- src:ai-act-ja:12 | （定義）
-- src:ai-act-ja:13 | 第二条 この法律において、「人工知能関連技術」とは、人工的な方法により人間の認知、推論及び判断に係る知的な能力を代替する機能を実現するために必要な技術並びに入力された情報を当該技術を利用して処理し、その結果を出力する機能を実現するための情報処理システムに関する技術をいう。
@ref Article 2 (src:34-39) (src:ai-act-ja:12-13)
GIVETH A `A provision`
`Article 2` MEANS
    `A provision` WITH
        `the provision`                         IS "Article 2"
        `in the main provisions`                IS TRUE
        `the article number`                    IS 2
        `part`                                  IS `Chapter I, General Provisions`
        `addressed to`                          IS `nobody: a purpose, a definition or a principle`
        `the verb form`                         IS `defines a term (をいう)`
        `what it means for a business operator` IS `defines the technology that makes a business a utilization business operator`
        `mechanisms affecting a private person` IS EMPTY

-- src:45 | (Basic Principles)
-- src:46 | Article 3 (1) Promoting research and development, and utilization of artificial
-- src:47 | intelligence-related technology is to be implemented based on policy for
-- src:48 | advancement of science, technology and creating innovation specified in Article
-- src:49 | 3 of the Basic Act on Science, Technology and Innovation, the basic principles
-- src:50 | specified in Chapter II of the Basic Act on Forming a Digital Society, and the
-- src:51 | basic principles specified in this article.
-- 日本語 (authoritative):
-- src:ai-act-ja:14 | （基本理念）
-- src:ai-act-ja:15 | 第三条 人工知能関連技術の研究開発及び活用の推進は、科学技術・イノベーション基本法第三条に定める科学技術・イノベーション創出の振興に関する方針及びデジタル社会形成基本法第二章に定める基本理念のほか、この条に定める基本理念に基づいて行うものとする。
--
-- Article 7 binds a business operator to act 基本理念にのっとり, "in accordance with the basic
-- principles", which are this Article.
@ref Article 3(1) (src:45-51) (src:ai-act-ja:14-15)
GIVETH A `A provision`
`Article 3(1)` MEANS
    `A provision` WITH
        `the provision`                         IS "Article 3(1)"
        `in the main provisions`                IS TRUE
        `the article number`                    IS 3
        `part`                                  IS `Chapter I, General Provisions`
        `addressed to`                          IS `nobody: a purpose, a definition or a principle`
        `the verb form`                         IS `is to (ものとする)`
        `what it means for a business operator` IS `the basic principles a business operator acts in accordance with`
        `mechanisms affecting a private person` IS EMPTY

-- src:52 | (2) Promoting research and development, and utilization of artificial intelligence -
-- src:53 | related technology is to be implemented with the objective of keeping the
-- src:54 | ability of researching and developing artificial intelligence-related technology
-- src:55 | in Japan as well as enhancing international competitiveness of industries
-- src:56 | relating to artificial intelligence-related technology, in light of artificial
-- src:57 | intelligence-related technology being a technology of basis on development of
-- src:58 | economy and society as its appropriate and effective utilization generates
-- src:59 | increased efficiency and advancement of administrative affairs and private -
-- src:60 | sector business activities, and creation of new industries, as well as being an
-- src:61 | important technology from the perspective of national security.
-- 日本語 (authoritative):
-- src:ai-act-ja:16 | ２ 人工知能関連技術の研究開発及び活用の推進は、人工知能関連技術が、その適正かつ効果的な活用によって行政事務及び民間の事業活動の著しい効率化及び高度化並びに新産業の創出をもたらすものとして経済社会の発展の基盤となる技術であるとともに、安全保障の観点からも重要な技術であることに鑑み、我が国において人工知能関連技術の研究開発を行う能力を保持するとともに、人工知能関連技術に関する産業の国際競争力を向上させることを旨として、行うものとする。
@ref Article 3(2) (src:52-61) (src:ai-act-ja:16)
GIVETH A `A provision`
`Article 3(2)` MEANS
    `A provision` WITH
        `the provision`                         IS "Article 3(2)"
        `in the main provisions`                IS TRUE
        `the article number`                    IS 3
        `part`                                  IS `Chapter I, General Provisions`
        `addressed to`                          IS `nobody: a purpose, a definition or a principle`
        `the verb form`                         IS `is to (ものとする)`
        `what it means for a business operator` IS `the basic principles a business operator acts in accordance with`
        `mechanisms affecting a private person` IS EMPTY

-- src:62 | (3) Promoting research and development, and utilization of artificial intelligence -
-- src:63 | related technology is to be implemented with the objective of promoting these
-- src:64 | initiatives comprehensively and systematically, in light of initiatives by
