        `in the main provisions`                IS TRUE
        `the article number`                    IS 4
        `part`                                  IS `Chapter I, General Provisions`
        `addressed to`                          IS `the national government (国)`
        `the verb form`                         IS `is responsible for (責務を有する)`
        `what it means for a business operator` IS `the measures a business operator must cooperate with`
        `mechanisms affecting a private person` IS EMPTY

