-- src:96 | (Responsibilities of Local Governments)
-- src:97 | Article 5 A local governments is responsible for formulating and implementing
-- src:98 | independent measures that reflect distinctive characteristics of their respective
-- src:99 | areas of the relevant local government, in accordance with the basic principles,
-- src:100 | as measures to be implemented by the local government, with an appropriate
-- src:101 | sharing of roles with the national government regarding the promotion of
-- src:102 | research and development, and utilization of artificial intelligence-related
-- src:103 | technology.
-- 日本語 (authoritative):
-- src:ai-act-ja:23 | （地方公共団体の責務）
-- src:ai-act-ja:24 | 第五条 地方公共団体は、基本理念にのっとり、人工知能関連技術の研究開発及び活用の推進に関し、国との適切な役割分担の下、地方公共団体が実施すべき施策として、その地方公共団体の区域の特性を生かした自主的な施策を策定し、及び実施する責務を有する。
--
-- Article 7's duty to cooperate is also with "the measures implemented ... by a local
-- government under the provisions of Article 5".
@ref Article 5 (src:96-103) (src:ai-act-ja:23-24)
