-- src:129 | (Responsibilities of Utilization Business Operators)
-- src:133 | Article 7 Any person who intends to develop or provide products or services that
-- src:134 | utilize artificial intelligence-related technology, or other persons who intend to
-- src:135 | utilize other artificial intelligence-related technology in their business
-- src:136 | activities (referred to below as a "utilization business operator"), is to endeavor
-- src:137 | to enhance the efficiency and advancement of business activities and create
-- src:138 | new industries through active utilization of artificial intelligence -related
-- src:139 | technology, and must cooperate with the measures implemented by the
-- src:140 | national government under the provisions of Article 4 and by a local
-- src:141 | government under the provisions of Article 5, in accordance with the basic
-- src:142 | principles.
-- 日本語 (authoritative):
-- src:ai-act-ja:29 | （活用事業者の責務）
-- src:ai-act-ja:30 | 第七条 人工知能関連技術を活用した製品又はサービスの開発又は提供をしようとする者その他の人工知能関連技術を事業活動において活用しようとする者（以下「活用事業者」という。）は、基本理念にのっとり、自ら積極的な人工知能関連技術の活用により事業活動の効率化及び高度化並びに新産業の創出に努めるとともに、第四条の規定に基づき国が実施する施策及び第五条の規定に基づき地方公共団体が実施する施策に協力しなければならない。
--
-- The only provision of the Act addressed to a business operator by name. Its first limb
-- is an endeavor (努める); its second, cooperation with Article 4 and Article 5 measures,
-- is 協力しなければならない. No consequence for not cooperating is stated here or anywhere in the
-- Act.
@ref Article 7 (src:129-142) (src:ai-act-ja:29-30)
GIVETH A `A provision`
`Article 7` MEANS
    `A provision` WITH
        `the provision`                         IS "Article 7"
        `in the main provisions`                IS TRUE
        `the article number`                    IS 7
        `part`                                  IS `Chapter I, General Provisions`
        `addressed to`                          IS `utilization business operators (活用事業者)`
        `the verb form`                         IS `endeavor, and must cooperate (努めるとともに、協力しなければならない)`
        `what it means for a business operator` IS `an endeavor, and a duty to cooperate`
        `mechanisms affecting a private person` IS EMPTY

-- src:144 | (Responsibilities of Citizens)
-- src:145 | Article 8 In accordance with the basic principles, the citizens are to endeavor to
-- src:146 | deepen their understanding and interest in artificial intelligence -related
-- src:147 | technology and to cooperate with the measures implemented by the national
-- src:148 | government under the provisions of Article 4 and by local governments under
-- src:149 | the provisions of Article 5.
-- 日本語 (authoritative):
-- src:ai-act-ja:31 | （国民の責務）
-- src:ai-act-ja:32 | 第八条 国民は、基本理念にのっとり、人工知能関連技術に対する理解と関心を深めるとともに、第四条の規定に基づき国が実施する施策及び第五条の規定に基づき地方公共団体が実施する施策に協力するよう努めるものとする。
-- Whether 努めるものとする governs 深める as well as 協力する is fork F12; the label
-- reads it as fork F1 reads Article 7. Article 8 is addressed to citizens, so no
-- answer for a business operator turns on it.
@ref Article 8 (src:144-149) (src:ai-act-ja:31-32)
GIVETH A `A provision`
`Article 8` MEANS
    `A provision` WITH
        `the provision`                         IS "Article 8"
        `in the main provisions`                IS TRUE
        `the article number`                    IS 8
        `part`                                  IS `Chapter I, General Provisions`
        `addressed to`                          IS `citizens (国民)`
        `the verb form`                         IS `deepens, and is to endeavor to cooperate (深めるとともに、協力するよう努めるものとする)`
        `what it means for a business operator` IS `none: not addressed to a business operator`
        `mechanisms affecting a private person` IS EMPTY

-- src:151 | (Strengthening of Coordination)
-- src:152 | Article 9 In light of the fact that mutual coordination and cooperation among the
-- src:153 | national government, a local government, a research and development institute
-- src:154 | and a utilization business operator can effectively achieve the promotion of
-- src:155 | research and development, and utilization of artificial intelligence-related
-- src:156 | technology, the national government is to take necessary measures to
