§ `Chapter II -- Basic Measures (第二章　基本的施策)`

-- src:166 | (Promoting Research and Development)
-- src:167 | Article 11 The national government is to promote integrated research and
-- src:168 | development activities, in artificial intelligence-related technology from basic
-- src:169 | research of it to research and development for its practical application,
-- src:170 | establish a system for transferring the results of research and development at
-- src:171 | a research and development institute, provide information on the results of
-- src:172 | research and development, and take other measures.
-- 日本語 (authoritative):
-- src:ai-act-ja:38 | （研究開発の推進等）
-- src:ai-act-ja:39 | 第十一条 国は、人工知能関連技術の基礎研究から実用化のための研究開発に至るまでの一貫した研究開発の推進、研究開発機関における研究開発の成果の移転のための体制の整備、研究開発の成果に係る情報の提供その他の施策を講ずるものとする。
@ref Article 11 (src:166-172) (src:ai-act-ja:38-39)
