        `the article number`                    IS 11
        `part`                                  IS `Chapter II, Basic Measures`
        `addressed to`                          IS `the national government (国)`
        `the verb form`                         IS `is to (ものとする)`
        `what it means for a business operator` IS `none: not addressed to a business operator`
        `mechanisms affecting a private person` IS EMPTY

-- src:177 | (Promoting the Development and Sharing of Facilities and Equipment)
-- src:178 | Article 12 The national government is to take necessary measures to promote
-- src:179 | the expansion and shared use of facilities and equipment related to large -scale
-- src:180 | information processing, information and communications, storage of
-- src:181 | electromagnetic records (meaning a record in the electronic form, magnetic
-- src:182 | form, or any other form not recognizable to human senses, and those used for
-- src:183 | information processing by electronic computer), as well as data set (meaning
-- src:184 | collection of the information collected for specific purposes) and other
-- src:185 | intellectual foundation (meaning an intellectual foundation as provided for in
-- src:186 | Article 24-4 of the Act for Activation of Science, Technology, and Creation
-- src:187 | Innovation; the same applies below in this Article), which are necessary for the
-- src:188 | research and development, and utilization of artificial intelligence-related
-- src:189 | technology, in order to make such facilities and equipment widely available to
-- src:190 | a research and development institution and a utilization business operator.
-- 日本語 (authoritative):
-- src:ai-act-ja:40 | （施設及び設備等の整備及び共用の促進）
-- src:ai-act-ja:41 | 第十二条 国は、人工知能関連技術の研究開発及び活用に当たって必要となる大規模な情報処理、情報通信、電磁的記録（電子的方式、磁気的方式その他人の知覚によっては認識することができない方式で作られる記録であって、電子計算機による情報処理の用に供されるものをいう。）の保管等に係る施設及び設備並びにデータセット（特定の目的をもって収集した情報の集合物をいう。）その他の知的基盤（科学技術・イノベーション創出の活性化に関する法律第二十四条の四に規定する知的基盤をいう。以下この条において同じ。）を研究開発機関及び活用事業者が広く利用できるようにするため、これらの施設及び設備並びに知的基盤の整備及び共用の促進のために必要な施策を講ずるものとする。
@ref Article 12 (src:177-190) (src:ai-act-ja:40-41)
GIVETH A `A provision`
`Article 12` MEANS
    `A provision` WITH
        `the provision`                         IS "Article 12"
        `in the main provisions`                IS TRUE
        `the article number`                    IS 12
        `part`                                  IS `Chapter II, Basic Measures`
        `addressed to`                          IS `the national government (国)`
        `the verb form`                         IS `is to (ものとする)`
        `what it means for a business operator` IS `names business operators as partners in, or users of, a government measure`
        `mechanisms affecting a private person` IS EMPTY

