-- src:213 | (Research and Study)
-- src:214 | Article 16 The national government is to collect information on trends of
-- src:215 | research and development, and utilization of artificial intelligence-related
-- src:216 | technology both domestically and internationally, analyze cases where the
-- src:217 | citizens' rights and interests are infringed due to research and development, or
-- src:221 | utilization of artificial intelligence-related technology by wrongful purposes or
-- src:222 | inappropriate methods, consider measures based on the analyzation, and
-- src:223 | conduct other research and studies contributing to promotion of research and
-- src:224 | development, and utilization of artificial intelligence-related technology, and
-- src:225 | the national government based on the results, is to give guidance, advice to a
-- src:226 | research and development institute, a utilization business operator and other
-- src:227 | people, and provide information for them, or take other necessary measures.
-- 日本語 (authoritative):
-- src:ai-act-ja:48 | （調査研究等）
-- src:ai-act-ja:49 | 第十六条 国は、国内外の人工知能関連技術の研究開発及び活用の動向に関する情報の収集、不正な目的又は不適切な方法による人工知能関連技術の研究開発又は活用に伴って国民の権利利益の侵害が生じた事案の分析及びそれに基づく対策の検討その他の人工知能関連技術の研究開発及び活用の推進に資する調査及び研究を行い、その結果に基づいて、研究開発機関、活用事業者その他の者に対する指導、助言、情報の提供その他の必要な措置を講ずるものとする。
--
-- The nearest provision to incident reporting: the NATIONAL GOVERNMENT collects
-- information and analyzes cases where citizens' rights and interests are infringed. It
-- places nothing on the business. Its "other necessary measures" (その他の必要な措置) is not
-- defined; it does not mention publication of names.
@ref Article 16 (src:213-227) (src:ai-act-ja:48-49)
