`Article 16` MEANS
    `A provision` WITH
        `the provision`                         IS "Article 16"
        `in the main provisions`                IS TRUE
        `the article number`                    IS 16
        `part`                                  IS `Chapter II, Basic Measures`
        `addressed to`                          IS `the national government (国)`
        `the verb form`                         IS `is to (ものとする)`
        `what it means for a business operator` IS `the national government is to give guidance, advice or information to the business`
        `mechanisms affecting a private person` IS EMPTY

