§ `Chapter III -- Artificial Intelligence Basic Plan (第三章　人工知能基本計画)`

-- src:236 | Article 18 (1) The government is to establish a basic plan for the promotion of
-- src:237 | research and development, and utilization of artificial intelligence-related
-- src:238 | technology (referred to below as "artificial intelligence basic plan") in
-- src:239 | accordance with the basic principles, and based on basic measures specified in
-- src:240 | the preceding chapter.
-- src:241 | (2) An artificial intelligence basic plan is to specify the following matters :
-- src:242 | (i) the basic policy on measures for promoting research and development, and
-- src:243 | utilization of artificial intelligence-related technology;
-- src:244 | (ii) measures that the government should take comprehensively and
-- src:245 | systematically for promoting research and development, and utilization of
-- src:246 | artificial intelligence-related technology; and
-- src:247 | (iii) in addition to the matters stated in the preceding two items, matters
-- src:248 | necessary for the government to comprehensively and systematically advance
-- src:249 | measures for promoting research and development, and utilization of
-- src:250 | artificial intelligence-related technology.
-- src:251 | (3) The Prime Minister is to seek a cabinet decision on the draft of artificial
-- src:252 | intelligence basic plan prepared by an artificial intelligence strategic
-- src:253 | headquarters.
-- src:254 | (4) If a cabinet decision under the preceding paragraph has been made, the Prime
-- src:255 | Minister is to make public the artificial intelligence basic plan without delay.
-- src:256 | (5) The provisions of the preceding two paragraphs apply mutatis mutandis to
-- src:257 | changes in the artificial intelligence basic plan.
-- 日本語 (authoritative):
-- src:ai-act-ja:53 | 第十八条 政府は、基本理念にのっとり、前章に定める基本的施策を踏まえ、人工知能関連技術の研究開発及び活用の推進に関する基本的な計画（以下「人工知能基本計画」という。）を定めるものとする。
-- src:ai-act-ja:54 | ２ 人工知能基本計画は、次に掲げる事項について定めるものとする。
-- src:ai-act-ja:55 | 一 人工知能関連技術の研究開発及び活用の推進に関する施策についての基本的な方針
-- src:ai-act-ja:56 | 二 人工知能関連技術の研究開発及び活用の推進に関し、政府が総合的かつ計画的に講ずべき施策
-- src:ai-act-ja:57 | 三 前二号に掲げるもののほか、人工知能関連技術の研究開発及び活用の推進に関する施策を政府が総合的かつ計画的に推進するために必要な事項
-- src:ai-act-ja:58 | ３ 内閣総理大臣は、人工知能戦略本部の作成した人工知能基本計画の案について閣議の決定を求めるものとする。
-- src:ai-act-ja:59 | ４ 内閣総理大臣は、前項の閣議の決定があったときは、遅滞なく、人工知能基本計画を公表するものとする。
-- src:ai-act-ja:60 | ５ 前二項の規定は、人工知能基本計画の変更について準用する。
--
-- Paragraph (4) is the only use of 公表 ("make public") in the Act; what is made public is
-- the Artificial Intelligence Basic Plan.
@ref Article 18 (src:236-257) (src:ai-act-ja:53-60)
GIVETH A `A provision`
`Article 18` MEANS
    `A provision` WITH
        `the provision`                         IS "Article 18"
        `in the main provisions`                IS TRUE
        `the article number`                    IS 18
        `part`                                  IS `Chapter III, Artificial Intelligence Basic Plan`
        `addressed to`                          IS `the Government (政府)`
        `the verb form`                         IS `is to (ものとする)`
        `what it means for a business operator` IS `none: not addressed to a business operator`
        `mechanisms affecting a private person` IS EMPTY

