-- src:358 | while taking into consideration of international trend concerning policies on
-- src:359 | promoting research and development and utilization of artificial intelligence -
-- src:360 | related technology, and other social and economic changes, and to take
-- src:361 | required measures based on the results of its review if it finds them to be
-- src:362 | necessary.
